@startuml implement-plan-pipeline
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888
skinparam ArrowColor #444
<style>
activityDiagram {
  .gate {
    BackgroundColor #FFF6DD
    LineColor #B8860B
  }
}
</style>

start
:Stabilization
stubs, migrations, contracts;
:Gate: compiles,
architecture test;<<gate>>
note right
  every gate runs the commands
  your **build.md** names
end note
:Red
unit, integration, system
tests in parallel waves;
:Gate: every new test
compiles and fails;<<gate>>
:Green
unit + integration in waves,
system one at a time;
:Gate: full suite green;<<gate>>
:Refactor
one agent, whole diff;
:Gate: still green,
same test count;<<gate>>
:Post-implementation
build, coverage;
note right
  the steps your **follow-up.md**
  gave the plan
end note
stop
@enduml
